[gd_resource type="Theme" format=3]

; The single shared theme, set project-wide in project.godot. Every colour and
; every size here comes from ui/theme/palette.gd — if you change one, change the
; other. Chunky 6px borders and 44px body text deliberately echo the original's
; thick-outlined GBC UI (dossier §10 [C]).
;
; Buttons are sized so the DEFAULT clears Palette.TOUCH_MIN (132) without any
; screen having to remember: 44px text + 2*42 content margin + 2*6 border = 140.
;
; Type variations available to every screen:
;   HugeLabel / TitleLabel / SmallLabel   light text at 96 / 72 / 34
;   InkLabel / InkSmallLabel              dark text, for use on PAPER or HudBox
;   HudBox (PanelContainer)               the original's `[DAYS 2  AM]` boxes
;   BigButton                             primary menu action, 172 tall
;   SmallButton                           smaller TEXT, not a smaller target, 154 tall
;
; Regenerate rather than hand-edit: this file is written by Godot's own
; ResourceSaver so the type variations serialise correctly.

